{"resourceIdentifier":"3661","resourceName":"Strengthening Rural Livelihood Through Carbon Finance: Agroforestry Practices In Moradabad Forest Circle Of Uttar Pradesh","description":"Agroforestry Practices as an alternate to fulfil the rising demand for timber and other non-timber forest produce is promising in long term as it provides both wood and food. Agroforestry can help to conserve and rehabilitate the ecosystem, along with providing better livelihood opportunities to the rural community. The proposed ARR VCS project plans to promote sustainable agroforestry for small-scale farmers to provide them with financial benefits and ensure GHG mitigation in the state of Uttar Pradesh, India.","location":{"latitude":28.841058,"longitude":78.795315},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-02-06","endExclusive":"2023-03-09","endInclusive":"2023-03-08"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3661"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Uttar Pradesh"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Department of Environment, Forest and Climate Change, Government of Uttar Pradesh"},{"type":"string","value":"Uttar Pradesh, India"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"148"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ARR"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AR-AMS0007"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4100 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Carbon Check (India) Private Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":